The four forge review comments are fixed, and `pytest tests/ -v` passed (32 tests).

**Tool routing.** `get employee emp-001` and `get sales order so-123` now select `get_employee_by_id` and `get_sales_order_by_id`, and the id is kept in `tool_args`. List questions still go to `list_employees` and `list_sales_order`.

**FastMCP SSE.** Tool calls open a GET on `MCP_URL` with `Accept: text/event-stream`, read the session endpoint, then POST `initialize`, `notifications/initialized`, and `tools/call` to that endpoint. A JSON-RPC POST straight to the SSE URL is rejected by the test peer.

**Tool coverage.** Tests exercise all four tools, including `so-123` → `SO-123` and `emp-001` → `EMP-001`.

**Health probe.** `/health` uses the same SSE GET and reads the status from the headers, so a live FastMCP stream is reported reachable without calling a tool.

