The four review comments are fixed, and all 32 tests passed.

`get employee emp-001` and `get sales order so-123` now route to `get_employee_by_id` and `get_sales_order_by_id` with the id kept in `tool_args`. List questions still use `list_employees` and `list_sales_order`. Ids are normalized on the way out (`emp-001` to `EMP-001`, `so-123` to `SO-123`).

Tool calls use the FastMCP SSE handshake: GET the SSE URL with `Accept: text/event-stream`, read the endpoint event, then POST `initialize`, `notifications/initialized`, and `tools/call` to that session URL. Tests talk to an in-process SSE peer that rejects a raw JSON-RPC POST to the SSE URL. The health probe uses that same GET, so a live SSE server is reported reachable.

